 and on Sundays, children are given an introduction to verses in Tamil."],["Restoran Nam Chau","restaurant",4.59608,101.07777,"54 Jln Bandar Timah","7AM-3PM, closed Sat","","","","r","Their dry curry noodles are topped with roast pork, chicken, prawns and a generous dousing of rich curry gravy. Twist a little lime into it, and the mix of spicy, sour, sweet and savoury makes the dish irresistible. Also, their white…"],["Restoran Kong Heng","restaurant",4.59653,101.07788,"75 Jln Bandar Timah","8AM-4:30PM, closed Wed","","","","r","Classic Chinese coffee shop with a variety of hawkers. They're noted best for their Ipoh kai see hor fun. The popiah (spring roll) is made fresh on the spot to order. Located next to equally renowned Thean Chun, one can be seated in…"],["Restoran Thean Chun","restaurant",4.59629,101.07781,"73 Jln Bandar Timah","8AM-4:30PM, closed Thu","","","","r","Also known as the \"hall of mirrors\" for the large mirrors adorning the walls of the coffee shop, it is famous for its pork satay and Ipoh kai see hor fun. Their caramel egg custard is a perennial favourite, and can sometimes sell out by…"],["Nam Heong Coffee Shop","bar",4.59318,101.07726,"2 Jln Bandar Timah","6AM-6PM","","","","r","This Chinese coffee shop is the home of the famous \"Ipoh White Coffee\" and has links to the big OldTown coffee chain too. The egg tarts are fresh out of the oven, all sweet and flaky. Also serves fried rice noodles and other local eats."],["Sin Yoon Loong Coffee Shop","bar",4.59328,101.07698,"1 Jalan Bandar Timah","","","","","r","Located across the street from Nam Heong Coffee Shop, they are rivals in the \"White Coffee\" business. A favoured breakfast location among locals, they also serve good kaya cakes, which are sponge cakes with coconut jam."],["Miners' Arms Bistro","bar",4.5972,101.07717,"8-10 Jln Dato Maharajalela","","","","","r","Mock Tudor pub complete with wonky stained wooden beams and correctly placed apostrophe. The convivial clientele is entirely ethnic Chinese but the inevitable karaoke is kept at a civilized volume."]]}